{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122686","id":4330809004,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAiLmrA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122686","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122686.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122686.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122686","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122686/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122686/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122686/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7b758f79c2e0a212935457cfaf4d3242f722d1c9","number":122686,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add worker threads to BVH","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAchieves up to 2-3x performance for broad phase collision testing. Broad phase collision was the slowest profiled component in my game (with a lot of moving objects). \r\n\r\nIt can be tested on: godot-benchmarks: Physics > CharacterBody 2D. \r\nThis PR cuts 40% off this benchmark on my Mac Pro M5\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR accelerates the BVH_Manager._check_for_collisions() function with WorkerThreads. It leaves all other pathways alone (as much as possible). \r\n\r\nThe threaded pathway can be turned on and off with a template parameter.\r\n\r\nI have tested the multithreaded BVH performance using my own game with an enemy horde chasing the player: \r\n\r\nMacOS M5 10 core - ~2-3x\r\nWindows 11 AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D, 8 core, 16 thread -  ~2-3x\r\nLinux Ubuntu NUC (12 years old, reporting 4 cores, think it is a low end Intel i5) - 20-30%\r\niOS 26.6, iPhone 11 Pro - 10 - 20% \r\nSteam Deck - ~2-3x\r\n\r\n*These numbers are the performance of the BVH, so 3x BVH performance might have a 10% speed up for my game overall.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state"